{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>「雷神索爾」男星基斯咸士禾夫（Chris Hemsworth）位於澳洲拜倫灣南部的千萬美元豪華莊園驚傳遭竊。當地時間11日清晨，有4名戴著頭套的蒙面歹徒趁著全家人熟睡之際潛入宅邸，不但手持刀械，更直接從車庫強行開走3輛汽車。</p><p>根據監視器（閉路電視）畫面顯示，這群4人組成的蒙面盜匪翻越前院安全圍欄闖入，其中更被拍到有2人持有刀械。歹徒直闖車庫後，將鑰匙留在車內的3輛車全數開走，所幸這起驚悚事件中，基斯咸士禾夫與妻子艾莎柏達姬（Elsa Pataky）及3名子女均平安無事，未造成任何人員傷亡。</p><figure><img alt=\"基斯咸士禾夫（Chris Hemsworth）澳洲豪宅遭4名歹徒爆竊。（網上照片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20241228/949716250563448832371045.jpeg/Q2icwEV06q2deKwx1dlG2BO0oKUexTlgz7vGUs-7xlI\"/><figcaption>基斯咸士禾夫（Chris Hemsworth）澳洲豪宅遭4名歹徒爆竊。（網上照片）</figcaption></figure><p>更多基斯咸士禾夫（Chris Hemsworth）與家人照片：</p><figure><img alt=\"基斯咸士禾夫與家人們。（IG@chrishemsworth）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261113/1197910894244270080127483.jpeg/x1W9sPVBD5esjZaNrbGDeQF2R-oEMwQrD2gK-A9oCvg\"/><figcaption>基斯咸士禾夫與家人們。（IG@chrishemsworth）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"基斯咸士禾夫與家人們。（IG@chrishemsworth）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261113/1197910903698755584561249.jpeg/tyRbxGPg6nvZbDFFgh4pf37k0XF6Lmf2CBFivAgRYrw\"/><figcaption>基斯咸士禾夫與家人們。（IG@chrishemsworth）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"基斯咸士禾夫與家人們。（IG@chrishemsworth）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261113/1197910901484032000495860.jpeg/Yvk2s93ndAL6tiT4npP0rx8LScFLHY1HRb7lw0W-5cM\"/><figcaption>基斯咸士禾夫與家人們。（IG@chrishemsworth）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"基斯咸士禾夫豪宅。（IG@chrishemsworth）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20231224/815565136927657984238765.jpeg/cfGmfaYPbwoh7lhx6a5TUyrWPK2NmrBXIR_ZDCEf2Qw\"/><figcaption>基斯咸士禾夫豪宅。（IG@chrishemsworth）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"基斯咸士禾夫豪宅。（IG@chrishemsworth）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20231224/815565134528385024546798.jpeg/wl9j_XGO_jPcsxYXJTdTiL56gKXLEz8Wc9f71HPX-9Q\"/><figcaption>基斯咸士禾夫豪宅。（IG@chrishemsworth）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"基斯咸士禾夫豪宅。（IG@chrishemsworth）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20231224/815565139410817024561309.jpeg/BsK2YdVbt8Q1T2yPujjIYC7FKWZBk_1I5saKQebGikE\"/><figcaption>基斯咸士禾夫豪宅。（IG@chrishemsworth）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"基斯咸士禾夫豪宅。（IG@chrishemsworth）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20231224/815565131881648128934286.jpeg/t5dhAR7DFhwBWcofTekWtvn7GRYLmmTz1e-6BtXvugY\"/><figcaption>基斯咸士禾夫豪宅。（IG@chrishemsworth）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"基斯咸士禾夫豪宅。（IG@chrishemsworth）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20231224/815564867263008768412506.jpeg/-PetAaSnNaxyDvAWriLGWR5aP4IyNSVTKiKV4CoileA\"/><figcaption>基斯咸士禾夫豪宅。（IG@chrishemsworth）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"基斯咸士禾夫與家人們。（IG@chrishemsworth）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261113/1197910897016836096451083.jpeg/dn8Nl2mkPHE9ODlBUv-dk_2ROZ_FJQ9ky6voP8ur6D8\"/><figcaption>基斯咸士禾夫與家人們。（IG@chrishemsworth）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"基斯咸士禾夫與家人們。（IG@chrishemsworth）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261113/1197910899281891328634812.jpeg/GI49oGRhVtB1Yx0_9puGHTDExCehcPLw-o5T7PqOU-w\"/><figcaption>基斯咸士禾夫與家人們。（IG@chrishemsworth）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"基斯咸士禾夫與家人們。（IG@chrishemsworth）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261113/1197910892809818112127893.jpeg/IfkSWgtKyJLqEIctOm4pC9C2mw-XA-zJj6Qps4-kKbM\"/><figcaption>基斯咸士禾夫與家人們。（IG@chrishemsworth）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"基斯咸士禾夫與家人們。（IG@chrishemsworth）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261113/1197910895137787904315796.jpeg/6gZKuavZRZBu5IAbghM1_3LwnbdQIaXei6EmQ4uhJkM\"/><figcaption>基斯咸士禾夫與家人們。（IG@chrishemsworth）</figcaption></figure><p>據外媒報導，事發當晚一家五口都在屋內休息，妻子艾莎回憶，她在凌晨2點左右曾聽見愛犬狂吠，當時以為只是尋常動靜而未多加留意，直到白天醒來調閱監視器畫面，才驚覺莊園遭外人入侵。夫妻兩發現愛車遭竊後，隨即於上午7點30分向新南威爾斯州警方（NSW Police）報案。</p><p>這棟價值高達7500萬美元（約6億港元）的隱蔽莊園，坐落於雨林邊緣，自2014年全家從洛杉磯移居澳洲以來，夫妻倆便頻繁展現親近自然與熱愛戶外生活的形象。</p><p>新南威爾斯州警方接獲報案後隨即展開刑事偵辦，目前搜捕行動已有初步斬獲。警方已分別在距離該豪宅約1小時車程的科拉基鎮，以及車程超過2小時的塔布拉姆地區，尋回其中2輛失竊車輛。</p><p>不過，第3輛車目前仍去向不明。警方正全力追緝在逃的4名嫌犯，並呼籲行經該區域或知情民眾提供相關線索，以便儘速將涉案歹徒繩之以法。</p><figure><img alt=\"延伸閱讀：尼古拉斯基治8千萬豪宅爆地陷　「7.6米巨坑」吞車道　恐隨時墜海（Instagram@nicolascagebyf）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260910/1174716366490439680938057.jpeg/wDrqvpFJDb3WcgSY4uCpS5fDwZ8dhd-2tY2aAbWNmgE\"/><figcaption>延伸閱讀：尼古拉斯基治8千萬豪宅爆地陷　「7.6米巨坑」吞車道　恐隨時墜海（Instagram@nicolascagebyf）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"尼古拉斯基治（Nicolas Cage）位於南加州馬里布（Malibu）的海濱豪宅驚陷「塌房」危機！（Instagram@devinyalkin）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260910/1174716941630181376426789.jpeg/fWiJXQKq4vpCpRkp9gJqqSDXQtjik_hoKGr9lyhq_Zc\"/><figcaption>尼古拉斯基治（Nicolas Cage）位於南加州馬里布（Malibu）的海濱豪宅驚陷「塌房」危機！（Instagram@devinyalkin）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"荷里活知名男星尼古拉斯基治（Nicolas Cage）位於馬里布的海濱豪宅塌陷，出現巨坑。（GettyImages）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260910/1174715787475161088195430.jpeg/1debrb_kfrsENS8CuAIRVwvlOzJ19A9bmbYQ0pm2ENI\"/><figcaption>荷里活知名男星尼古拉斯基治（Nicolas Cage）位於馬里布的海濱豪宅塌陷，出現巨坑。（GettyImages）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"尼古拉斯基治Nicolas Cage（Instagram@televisionacad）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260910/1174716943844904960742516.jpeg/1frPjldc0hT4GkuVDTEwSQR6R_GVeFt3qPlnHaj5Zx0\"/><figcaption>尼古拉斯基治Nicolas Cage（Instagram@televisionacad）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"尼古拉斯基治Nicolas Cage（Instagram@nicolascagebyf）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260910/1174716945975742464430267.jpeg/oFvYhW4fm0t5c2uKH0AESOVGlqiHqn4HNVSHDDVUhww\"/><figcaption>尼古拉斯基治Nicolas Cage（Instagram@nicolascagebyf）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"尼古拉斯基治Nicolas Cage（Instagram@nicolascagebyf）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260910/1174716947901059072697238.jpeg/oAeJf44koBeQz3agHD5conVqUNgzZ8dq7rhqDO64agw\"/><figcaption>尼古拉斯基治Nicolas Cage（Instagram@nicolascagebyf）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"尼古拉斯基治Nicolas Cage（Instagram@nicolascagebyf）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260910/1174716949939621888853162.jpeg/1dlr-Z_XJhYNE069oOqrEMm9AktfhBErs1PBOrNTwTo\"/><figcaption>尼古拉斯基治Nicolas Cage（Instagram@nicolascagebyf）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"尼古拉斯基治Nicolas Cage（Instagram@nicolascagebyf）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260910/1174716941202362368249057.jpeg/aYD0_UyVmQ9E6c_K2ulSewCJTTHJkMMkta33hLWt94Q\"/><figcaption>尼古拉斯基治Nicolas Cage（Instagram@nicolascagebyf）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"尼古拉斯基治Nicolas Cage（Instagram@gq）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260910/1174716943421280256609148.jpeg/BJ8RidBFeN9Y7x5PKe5oGddqmh82ytDi1VIhG9VSIRs\"/><figcaption>尼古拉斯基治Nicolas Cage（Instagram@gq）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"尼古拉斯基治Nicolas Cage（Instagram@francescafarahofficial）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260910/1174716945380151296238407.jpeg/kKqBZG6imw62qC3WxVZJ8jeMf7GTti6Hd9041HfdONQ\"/><figcaption>尼古拉斯基治Nicolas Cage（Instagram@francescafarahofficial）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"尼古拉斯基治Nicolas Cage（Instagram@pinterest）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260910/1174716947418714112213974.jpeg/iBP6zye1pgJYahCs7Iyru707Fyo1I30xXg8HxF4PB8Q\"/><figcaption>尼古拉斯基治Nicolas Cage（Instagram@pinterest）</figcaption></figure><p>亞洲日舞 「雷神2」導演亞倫泰勒當講師將來台</p><p>「變形金剛：源起」強勢摘下全台冠軍 雷神配音獲好評</p><p>【本文獲「聯合新聞網」授權轉載。】</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T11:40:40.197042+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1659,"images":24,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T11:30:40+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T11:54:26.359036+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T11:34:11.556395+00:00","content_hash":"2569f8df09a13729e1218b78bfd42d3e334bfd2d4671bb9f8bda8be2fbe48e83","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}